      "backgroundName" : "ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png",
      "telop" : "僕は、彼女の意思を確認すると、過去を思い返しながら話す。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 4.356077097505669,
