      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「でも、本当に酔い潰れたら、もっとひどくなりますから、それに比べれば、まだ健全の範囲ですよ。」僕はそう、助言する。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 8.819115646258503,
      "title" : "シーン 1511",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1511",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1511.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.819115646258503,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "9AA85C44-443A-47B6-B42F-36CACA671921",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1512_操夢.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image65.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「ただ、浴室で怪我されても困るので、\nそこで少し座って待ってください。」",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 5.006077097505669,
      "title" : "シーン 1512",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1512",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1512.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 5.006077097505669,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "A8FDB0B9-B0CE-4DD1-8CEB-49695B20EEEB",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1513_操夢.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image65.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg",
      "telop" : "僕はそう言うと、バックからあるものを2つ取り出す。それは、黒色のアイマスクだった。そして、それを一つ彼女につける。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 8.45063492063492,
      "title" : "シーン 1513",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1513",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1513.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.45063492063492,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "11604D42-6B39-4ABF-95BC-17EADE190A58",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1514_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image65.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「ちょっと、何するのよ。」",
      "voiceCharacter" : "アリス・マーガトロイド",
      "duration" : 1.4037414965986394,
      "title" : "シーン 1514",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1514",
      "characterName" : "アリス・マーガトロイド",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_char_2DB3",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1514.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 1.4037414965986394,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "1EC5585C-EE77-40D2-88E6-2A70A7C662CB",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1515_操夢.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image65.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「こういう時のために、向こうで買ったんですよ。互いにアイマスクを被れば、僕が浴室の中でアリスさんの体を支えますから…」",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 8.458253968253969,
      "title" : "シーン 1515",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1515",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1515.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.458253968253969,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "7C2371AE-B27B-4F08-BEE3-4AE6627D4EC1",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1516_操夢.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image65.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「ただ、触覚だけはどうにもならないので、そこは我慢してください。何より怪我なく、お風呂に入れるのが一番ですから。」",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 8.049546485260771,
      "title" : "シーン 1516",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1516",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1516.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.049546485260771,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "BB64F52E-BEBA-4389-AC53-04E2DDA106E6",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1517_操夢.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image65.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg",
      "telop" : "僕はそう言いながら、アイマスクを被る。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 2.4017233560090703,
      "title" : "シーン 1517",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1517",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1517.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 2.4017233560090703,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "F8681495-1FFE-4EDF-A09D-752730C1B246",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1518_操夢.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "単色背景",
      "telop" : "僕は、暗闇の中、スッと息を吸い、神経を透き済ますと、触覚だけを頼り、彼女の服を脱がせ、自分自身も服を脱ぐ。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 8.910430839002268,
      "title" : "シーン 1518",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1518",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1518.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.910430839002268,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "32855A95-2E14-4F54-858E-23508D34B5A5",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1519_操夢.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "単色背景",
      "telop" : "そして、彼女をそっと抱え上げると、浴室の段差に気をつけながら、中に入っていき、そのまま彼女の入浴を補助するのだった。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 8.646303854875283,
      "title" : "シーン 1519",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1519",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1519.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.646303854875283,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "6124AA05-191F-4738-99DB-9014EC6E8510",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1520_操夢.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image65.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg",
      "telop" : "僕は、アリスを入浴させると、彼女が一人で出られるといい、僕は、一人ベッドに座り、ぼんやりとしていた。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 7.35390022675737,
      "title" : "シーン 1520",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1520",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1520.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 7.35390022675737,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "87A6C3A6-8BF5-4B3E-8539-C3AB5570DCD9",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1521_操夢.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image65.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg",
      "telop" : "ふと時計を見ると、夜の9時だった。そして、僕は背伸びをする。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 4.581065759637188,
      "title" : "シーン 1521",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1521",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1521.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 4.581065759637188,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "721C39E4-308D-4DC0-AA9B-0F05547C511D",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1522_操夢.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image65.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg",
      "telop" : "僕が、ぼんやりと過ごしていると、浴室から大きな物音がする。\n僕は、なんだか嫌な予感がし、扉越しに様子を尋ねる。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 8.710430839002267,
      "title" : "シーン 1522",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1522",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1522.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.710430839002267,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "CAE89F4B-BA83-4BD4-B6CD-4CAD61255B25",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1523_操夢.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image65.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg",
      "telop" : "だが、返事は返ってこず、僕は一度外したアイマスクをつけ、\n扉を開けて中に、入ると、そこには気絶した彼女がいた。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 8.464761904761906,
      "title" : "シーン 1523",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1523",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1523.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.464761904761906,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "id" : "3F1828B6-044E-46FD-8F9D-D4B8ED49BCBD",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1524_操夢.wav",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image65.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg",
      "telop" : "僕は、強めに彼女の頬を叩くと、彼女は意識を取り戻し、\nなんとかことなきを得るのだった。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "duration" : 6.291950113378685,
      "title" : "シーン 1524",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #1524",
